<title>USA: Okabena lowers Sparta Foods stake.</title>
<headline>Okabena lowers Sparta Foods stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Okabena Partnership K Thursday said it lowered its stake in Sparta Foods Inc to 15.1 percent or 1.1 million common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the Minnesota general partnership said it sold 100,000 shares of Sparta Foods between August 12 and October 16 at prices ranging from $1.03 to $1.81 a share.</p>
